    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the weather radar transceiver, its tray and the antenna drive at the radome bulkhead, covering the magnetron, solid state and stabilised drive standards.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "To identify the parts of the weather radar installation at the radome bulkhead across the three released standards.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn looking aft with the radome open. Item 10 is the solid state transceiver, which supersedes the magnetron unit no longer supplied; the tray shim stack at item 60 differs between the two and the packer plates fitted with the magnetron unit are not re-used. Item 20 and item 20A are the display unit assembly and the interface unit it replaced at the stabilised drive standard, and the two are not interchangeable because the display bus loading differs. The antenna and its drive are supplied as a matched set at the stabilised standard and are not separately listed."
    },
